   "text": "just spitting dust around.",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 2.75,
   "block": "cleaning.dlg31",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Could be. Also dust top to bottom, shelves first, floor last, so you only clean each layer once.",
